From 8c8773dd6e787488ab1e07f8156c93b838711cf8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valera <valera@example.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 18:01:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] arm64: configs: Disable SCHEDSTATS debugging overhead

atrace.rc force-enables sched_schedstats at boot (on late-init:
write /proc/sys/kernel/sched_schedstats 1), so CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS=y
from gki_defconfig means per-task run-delay accounting runs in
production. Disable the kernel option entirely.

Userspace impact checked: /proc/<pid>[/task/<tid>]/schedstat
disappears (gated on CONFIG_SCHED_INFO, selected only by
SCHEDSTATS). All known readers degrade gracefully: llkd falls
back to reading /sched and exits early, art prints '0 0 0',
AnrTimer skips cpu_delay, ProcessCpuTracker tolerates missing
file. Kernel stats are still available via /proc/<pid>/sched
(CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG=y).

Change-Id: I7ac745f989ec5a9b330a086c13c2406e36fa6aee
---
 arch/arm64/configs/vendor/xiaomi_QGKI.config | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/xiaomi_QGKI.config b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/xiaomi_QGKI.config
index 867fad96c476..c63ead5d43df 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/xiaomi_QGKI.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/vendor/xiaomi_QGKI.config
@@ -51,3 +51,7 @@ CONFIG_NET_SCH_FQ=y
 
 # Disable page owner debug overhead
 # CONFIG_PAGE_OWNER is not set
+
+
+# Disable scheduler stats overhead (also force-enabled at boot by atrace.rc)
+# CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS is not set
